# certvis sites list
#
# One site per line: "hostname", "hostname:port", or a full URL like
# "https://hostname/path" (scheme and path are stripped; port defaults to
# 443). Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored; trailing
# "# ..." is stripped from a line too.

github.com
google.com
cloudflare.com

# badssl.com hosts edge cases handy for exercising certvis itself.
# Uncomment any of these to see the corresponding status on the dashboard:
#
# expired.badssl.com          -> expired cert (dark red)
# wrong.host.badssl.com       -> valid cert, wrong hostname
# self-signed.badssl.com      -> untrusted chain
# untrusted-root.badssl.com   -> untrusted chain
# revoked.badssl.com          -> revoked (still parses fine here)
# this-hostname-does-not-exist.example.invalid  -> unreachable (black bar)
